&lt;li&gt;Strong discipline to execute a proven sales process from start to finish alongside a coachable mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to succeed in a &quot;team sales&quot; environment by effectively utilizing internal and partner resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German&lt;/li&gt;
