&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Build and maintain the ARR bridge and driver-based cohort models as the single source of truth across Finance, Sales Ops, and executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Partner directly with GTM leadership to challenge and align on pipeline assumptions, deal economics, and quota attainability during forecast calls and strategy sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Drive ACV bookings forecasting and pipeline conversion modeling across direct and partner channels by integrating Salesforce and signal data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Model gross and net churn by cohort, segment, and product line, building predictive models for at-risk accounts using product usage and support data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Lead topline workstreams for Annual Operating Plan cycles, multi-scenario financial modeling, quarterly earnings preparation, and board-level reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
