&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;You are data-driven. You use data and analytics to find the truth, measure what matters, and guide informed decisions, replacing assumptions with evidence to drive better outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You excel at creating frameworks and bringing clarity to fast-moving, complex enterprise SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;You act like an owner. You take end-to-end accountability for topline architecture, navigating seamlessly between complex quantitative modeling and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;You operate with urgency. You maintain a relentless focus on execution, delivering high-impact financial insights quickly to support high-growth sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You build strong, direct partnerships across Sales, Marketing, and Operations, delivering candid feedback with clarity and respect to align executive teams.&lt;/li&gt;
