&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;8+ years of progressive experience in FP&amp;amp;A, GTM Finance, Revenue Operations, or Sales Strategy at a high-growth enterprise SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in SaaS topline metrics, including ACV, TCV, ARR, NRR, GRR, churn, and pipeline analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Proven ability to engage as an analytically credible peer with senior GTM operators and Sales Operations leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;Track record of leading high-performing analytical finance professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on proficiency with Salesforce for pipeline, opportunity, and revenue analytics&lt;/li&gt;
