&lt;p&gt;We value high-impact, high-accountability with a sense of urgency where you’re enabled to do your best work and embrace your potential. If you’re driven by purpose, thrive on solving complex challenges, and want to be part of the team that’s helping to secure the AI age, we invite you to bring your talents to Zscaler and help shape the future of cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt; We are looking for a Director, Technical Success Management&amp;nbsp; to join our team. This is a Hybrid role, reporting to the VP of Customer Success in the Customer Success department. Zscaler accelerates digital transformation by protecting thousands of enterprise customers through its pioneering, AI-powered Zero Trust Exchange platform. In this strategic leadership role, you will scale a high-performing technical success organization, elevate leadership capabilities across your team, and drive exceptional customer outcomes, retention, and platform value across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
