&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience or familiarity leveraging AI-guided threat hunting, automated playbook orchestration, or machine learning anomaly detection to accelerate incident response&lt;/p&gt;
