&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in enterprise EUC, endpoint management, or desktop engineering within cloud-first environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in Windows and macOS administration alongside UEM platforms such as CrowdStrike, Jamf, Microsoft Intune/MEM, Workspace ONE, and ServiceNow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record running vulnerability management, patch compliance, and risk mitigation at enterprise scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical diagnostic skills across device security, OS performance, network stacks, hardware, and productivity software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid foundation in Zero Trust architecture, excellent stakeholder communication skills, and the flexibility for after-hours on-call or on-site support during major incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
