&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with end-user digital experience monitoring tools such as Zscaler Digital Experience (ZDX) or Omnissa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications such as Microsoft Certified: Modern Desktop Administrator, Jamf Certified, CrowdStrike, or Zscaler credentials.&lt;/li&gt;
