&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
