&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Success in leveraging data analysis and UX techniques to optimize user experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
