&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with deep experience in cloud infrastructure, platform, networking, security, or enterprise software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
