&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of distributed systems, cloud architecture, platform services, and operational reliability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
