&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Renewal Specialist in Japan reporting to the Emerging Renewals Manager in the Sales and Go-to-Market department. As a Renewal Specialist, you will be an integral part of Zscaler&#39;s global Sales and Go-to-Market team, focused on delighting customers, nurturing trusted partnerships, and driving a secure, cloud-enabled digital future. You will play a crucial role in cementing our position as a world leader in cloud security by managing renewals and contributing to customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
