&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strategic advisor, adept at holistically analyzing accounts to drive digital transformation through renewals and upsells.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive and results-oriented, skilled at prescribing approaches to increase customer stickiness and recurring revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a collaborative team player, able to work effectively across various internal departments to deliver compliant, proactive solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a strong sense of organization, managing multiple priorities while ensuring visibility and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are curious and customer-focused, dedicated to understanding and meeting customer goals to strengthen long-term partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
