&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong background in renewal sales or account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to cultivate an understanding of accounts to recognize and lead the process to strengthen contracts (e.g., co-terming, true-ups, longer term contracts, positioning future upgrades and services)&lt;/li&gt;
