&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior IT Help Desk Specialist to join our team. This is a San Jose, CA role, reporting to the Director, IT Operations - Digital Employee Experience in the IT Digital Employee Experience department. In this position, you will provide comprehensive technical support and ensure smooth IT operations for our employees. This role balances technical expertise and customer service to deliver hands-on troubleshooting, hardware lifecycle management, and a seamless digital employee experience as a key technical touchpoint for our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
