&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;About &lt;strong&gt;Zscaler&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler accelerates digital transformation to ensure our customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. As an &lt;strong&gt;AI-forward enterprise&lt;/strong&gt;, we are constantly pushing the envelope, leveraging the world’s largest security data lake to power our cloud-native Zero Trust Exchange platform. This innovation protects our customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here, &lt;strong&gt;impact in your role matters more than title&lt;/strong&gt; and trust is built on results. We say, impact over activity. We seek innovators who actively use AI to amplify their impact and who thrive in an environment where we leverage intelligent systems to stay ahead of evolving threats. We believe in transparency and value &lt;strong&gt;constructive, honest debate&lt;/strong&gt;—we’re focused on getting to the best ideas, faster. We build high-performing teams that can make an impact quickly and with high quality. To do this, we are building a culture of execution centered on &lt;strong&gt;customer obsession&lt;/strong&gt;, collaboration, ownership, and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value high-impact, high-accountability with a sense of urgency where you’re enabled to do your best work and embrace your potential. If you’re driven by purpose, thrive on solving complex challenges, and want to be part of the team that’s helping to secure the AI age, we invite you to bring your talents to Zscaler and help shape the future of cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://image.synthesia.io/c57d35c1-5686-4e34-bec6-bba734f90ab1/thumbnail.gif&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Sr. Manager of Software Engineering to join our team. This is a hybrid role, reporting to the Director, Engineering in the Zero Trust Exchange department. The Sr. Manager will oversee Identity and Access control infrastructure while leading a dynamic team advancing Zero Trust technology and flagship cloud security products. In this role, you will manage end-to-end development and quality, collaborating globally with architects, product managers, developers, and engineers to ensure successful production delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote the product vision internally and externally as the representative of the company, product, and team at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product management to develop roadmaps, identify gaps, and implement changes for improved outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions and implement with cloud reliability, availability, scalability, and security in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with teams and experts to ensure project requirements are met and delivered efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to budget planning by assessing resource needs, hardware requirements, metrics, and costs for cloud services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience in software development, enterprise services, networking, and security across large organizations or startups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building control plane systems on globally distributed databases and skilled in authentication and authorization mechanisms like SAML, OAuth, LDAP, and SCIM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in integrating software systems using distributed message queues like RabbitMQ/Kafka and distributed caches like Redis/Memcached&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in distributed systems, data replication protocols like Paxos variants, and enterprise databases like DynamoDB, Cassandra, or Google Spanner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI/ML models to automate identity threat detection, optimize access management policies, or enhance cloud security operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in using Kubernetes for orchestrating containerized applications and managing microservices architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

