&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Sr. Product Marketing Manager to join our team. This is a on-site in San Jose role, reporting to the Sr. Director, Product Marketing - Marketing - ZT Networking in the Marketing department. As a Sr. Product Marketing Manager responsible for Zscaler’s Zero Trust Cloud, you will be involved with development and execution of go-to-market plans for Zscaler’s solutions to connect and secure hybrid cloud workloads. We are looking for an extremely motivated team player to deliver compelling messaging that addresses real customer use cases and challenges as we accelerate the adoption of the Zscaler platform to secure workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
