&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Sr. Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join Zscaler’s core product marketing team to support &lt;strong&gt;Zscaler Private Access (ZPA)&lt;/strong&gt;. This role reports to the Director, Product Marketing for the ZPA team. &amp;nbsp;In this role, you will be a key driver in sharing our story in compelling and expressive ways. You will collaborate with diverse, creative people around the globe to hone the Zscaler brand, increase awareness and demand, support partnerships, and drive home big wins for the world’s cloud security leader and our customers worldwide. This &lt;strong&gt;hybrid role is based in San Jose, CA&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-To-Market Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute the GTM strategy encompassing positioning, packaging, marketing campaign tactics, pipeline generation, and solutions selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Messaging &amp;amp; Content:&lt;/strong&gt; Create compelling product collateral and messaging that addresses customer challenges and drives solutions adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Management Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with product management to synthesize technical outputs into clear, impactful value propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Launches: &lt;/strong&gt;Plan and coordinate with cross-functional teams to launch new products and releases successfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;: Support customer-facing teams with sales tools, messaging, training materials, and collaboration on corporate and field marketing campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
