&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of enterprise security trends, security operations challenges, and managed security services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in launching and scaling B2B SaaS, security solutions, or managed security services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in launching differentiated products and driving market adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
