&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3cb6283a1cecbd5b-331&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education and professional experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3cb6283a1cecbd5b-332&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0,0&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in presales roles, with at least 5 years specifically focused on selling security solutions and technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
