&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3cb6283a1cecbd5b-335&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Technical proficiency with GPO, Active Directory/LDAP, and SSO/SAML integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
