&lt;p&gt;We value high-impact, high-accountability with a sense of urgency where you’re enabled to do your best work and embrace your potential. If you’re driven by purpose, thrive on solving complex challenges, and want to be part of the team that’s helping to secure the AI age, we invite you to bring your talents to Zscaler and help shape the future of cybersecurity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Sales Engineer to join our team. This is a remote role for candidates based within commuting distance of London, the South East, or the Midlands, reporting to the Sales Engineering Manager in the Solutions Consulting (Public Sector) department. You will lead the technical charge in protecting UK public sector infrastructure and drive mission-critical cloud security outcomes across government and public sector organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and whiteboard the Zscaler cloud security platform to prospective customers to demonstrate clear architectural value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the vision and translate complex goals into enticing, relevant recommendations that resonate with public sector stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to our clients, guiding them through every stage of their digital transformational journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather technical requirements and promote the value proposition through impactful POVs, presentations, and demonstrations with prospects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 7 years of experience as a Sales Engineer, Systems Integrator, or Senior Architect within a public sector organization in particular defence organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive knowledge of enterprise network or cloud security technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to deliver technical whiteboards, produce high-quality presentations, and conduct live demonstrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with sales teams to identify, qualify, and scope opportunities while delivering proof of concept engagements to achieve technical victories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience positioning or securing AI-driven threat protection platforms and AI-enabled cloud security architectures within public sector environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Platform certifications or industry-standard credentials such as CISSP or CCNP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical experience in SASE, Proxy technology, Cybersecurity, IPS, DLP, CASB, CNAPP, or advanced Networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
