&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You thrive in ambiguity by comfortably building the path as you walk it, viewing a dynamic environment as raw material to create meaningful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
