&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You are a natural problem-solver who is energized by complex challenges and laser-focused on delivering high-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator who is ambitious for the team&#39;s success, actively embracing a culture of candor, respect, and continuous feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;You are a lifelong learner with a growth mindset, constantly developing your skills and seeking purpose in everything you do.&lt;/li&gt;
