&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of AI security frameworks, threat modeling for large language models, and mitigating vulnerabilities unique to AI-driven architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with DevOps pipelines, VPN technologies, and a strong understanding of security protocols and standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience writing testable, low-complexity code with dependency injection, proficiency in Swift or Python, and direct experience validating AI-driven products using MLOps principles&lt;/li&gt;
