&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;Create and deliver technical product presentations to prospective customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;Gather customer technical requirements to ensure proposed solutions align to goals and needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;Lead product evaluations and custom product configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;Design evaluation test plans with customers and guide the process to successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
