&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator&amp;nbsp;— candid, respectful, and ambitious for the team, not just yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;You are driven by innovation&amp;nbsp;— curious, energized by complex technical challenges, and always seeking better, more secure, scalable ways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;You are resilient and adaptable&amp;nbsp;— steady under pressure and effective through change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;You lead with integrity&amp;nbsp;— doing the right thing, holding high standards, and building trust through transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntf _1ibi0s3f3 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3e8&quot;&gt;Demonstrated curiosity and active exploration of AI tools, with a proven history of integrating new technologies to enhance daily workflows and augment problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
