&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building security products that enable organizations to adopt AI applications and agents safely and at scale. This is a hybrid capacity based in Bangalore role, reporting to the Director of Software Engineering. You will act as a hands-on Senior Software Engineer leading key product capabilities, taking full ownership of complex technical initiatives, shaping architectural direction, and guiding other engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of major product capabilities, owning projects from problem definition through implementation, rollout, and production operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design secure, reliable, and scalable systems with clearly defined trust boundaries, making technical decisions that balance security, privacy, performance, reliability, and usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex investigations while improving engineering practices, testing, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and provide direction through design and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and research teams while contributing to technical strategy and longer-term architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-4 years of software-engineering experience, including ownership of complex production systems and a demonstrated ability to lead technically ambiguous, cross-functional projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in systems engineering, distributed systems, security engineering, backend platforms, or endpoint software, combined with strong proficiency in Go, Rust, and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing systems with clear security, privacy, and reliability requirements, alongside a strong understanding of concurrency, networking, storage, APIs, and operational observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing Cloud Infrastructure on one of the Hyperscalers: AWS, GCP, or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building security, cloud, or enterprise software, including endpoint software for Windows, MacOS, and Linux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI applications, agents, developer platforms, or AI security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with security policy, detection, analysis, or software supply-chain systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
