&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Oversee all cloud infrastructure components such as AWS, private cloud environments, containers, and VMs to ensure stability and scalability&lt;/p&gt;
