&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Collaborating with external teams to deliver integrated solutions and ensure seamless system functionality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Contributing to Agile/Scrum processes, including sprint planning and retrospectives, to drive project success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
