&lt;li&gt;Identify systemic risks, architectural gaps, and investments needed for long-term growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
