&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You build strong relationships through clear feedback, respect, and a commitment to team success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are driven by innovation. You possess a deep curiosity for how systems work and are energized by solving technical challenges at the cutting edge of AI security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated curiosity and active exploration of AI tools, with a proven history of integrating new technologies to enhance daily workflows and augment problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software-engineering experience, including technical leadership across complex production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Go, Rust, and Python, with deep expertise in systems engineering, security engineering, and backend platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience architecting and evolving platforms that span multiple teams or product areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to remain hands-on through coding, prototyping, design review, and complex debugging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of concurrency, networking, storage, APIs, data systems, and cloud infrastructure on AWS, GCP, or Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
